Use CMake to create makefile from source directory
Fortran to be compiled with mingw-w64 compiler
 
Setup and Cython to be compiled with MSV compiler (same as Python, 2017?)
Include libblas.dll and liblapack.dll

libblas.dll and liblapack.dll need libgcc_s_sjlj-1.dll whic is part of x86_64-8.1.0-posix-sjlj-rt_v6-rev0

MikTex and Perl needed for reporting under pylatex using latexmk